	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Usage

Trigger with the configured Hotkey or Keyword (`ctu` by default) to copy the frontmost browser's active tab title and URL.

- Type to filter patterns with live formatted preview
- `↩` (or double-click / click Copy ↩): copy the selected pattern
- `⌘S` (or click Save .webloc ⌘S): save the current URL as a `.webloc` file to the frontmost Finder or QSpace window (via `fmctl`, fallback to Desktop)
- `⎋`: close

### Supported browsers
Yab, Safari, Safari Technology Preview, Orion, Arc, Dia, Google Chrome (incl. Canary/Beta), Chromium, Brave Browser, Microsoft Edge, Vivaldi, Opera.

### Supported patterns
Configure custom patterns in Workflow Configuration using keywords `title`, `url`, and `surl` (shortened URL). Lines starting with `#` are ignored.

```
title
[title](url)
title - url
url
surl
title - surl
[title](surl)
=HYPERLINK("url", "title")
```</string>
